# The framework-extension spifly variant installs a weaving hook that breaks class loading
# in org.apache.felix.http.jetty ("Weaving hook failed" -> ClassFormatError in
# HttpServiceController), so no HTTP service, no Jakarta REST whiteboard runtime and no
# JpaDataResource - every test then times out waiting for the resource. The resolver prefers
# it over the classic spifly.dynamic.bundle unless it is blacklisted here.
-runblacklist: \
	bnd.identity;id='org.eclipse.fennec.model.atlas.management.apicurio',\
	bnd.identity;id='org.gecko.emf.osgi.component.minimal',\
	bnd.identity;id='org.apache.aries.spifly.dynamic.framework.extension'